<view class="page {{role}}"><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="heading-title">转售货款</view><view class="subtitle">查看代理应付变动记录，实际付款仍需平台审核。</view><view class="note" style="margin-top:25rpx">以下金额为每笔应付变动，不代表已到账现金。退款审核、留存分配和实际结算尚未开放。</view><view class="card record" wx:for="{{payables}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><text class="status">{{labels[item.status]||item.status}}</text></view><view class="amount">应付变动 ¥ {{item.amount}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.date}}</view><view class="id">{{item.id}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!payables.length}}" class="empty">暂无应付记录</view></block></view>